	"description" : "This wallpaper allows you to use multifunctional widgets over a static background image.\nWidgets can be moved by dragging and expanded by double-clicking (on some widgets) to display more information.\nWidgets will snap to each other's corners or corner extensions, making it easy to align them neatly.\nAll widgets can be individually shown or hidden.\nHere is the list of available widgets:\n[list]\n[*]Clock Widget — Expandable. When expanded, you can set up to three world clocks.\n[*]Date Widget — Expandable. When expanded, it shows a list of this week's days.\n[*]Visualizer Widget — Expandable. When expanded, it displays the album title and track duration.\n[*]Weather Widget — Expandable. When expanded, it shows the current wind speed and precipitation probability.\n[*]Custom Widget — Expandable. When expanded, it displays additional custom text.\n[*]Progress Widget — Not expandable. You can add up to four progress widgets.\n[*]Performance Widget — Expandable. When expanded, it can monitor up to five items.\n[*]Performance Widget (Individual) — Not expandable. You can add up to six performance widgets. For CPU and GPU, the temperature is also displayed if available.\nTo set up performance monitor, download [url=https://github.com/sheetau/PerformanceMonitor]PerformanceMonitor app[/url] from GitHub.\n[*]Countdown Widget — Not expandable. You can add up to ten countdown widgets.\n[/list]\nFor more detailed information, please refer to the description in the wallpaper's user properties.\nIf you have issue with performance monitor, please ask on [url=https://discord.gg/2dXs5HwXuW]my discord server[/url] with details (not just \"it doesn't work\") and not my dm.\n\n\nwallpaper creator (design & code): sheet4.vn(sheeta)\nmade with HTML, CSS, Javascript.\n[url=https://ko-fi.com/sheeta]👉🏻 support me on ko-fi here 👈🏻[/url]\n\nbackground: [url=https://i.redd.it/rudl2pml5aad1.jpeg]source[/url]\ntags: customizable, world clock, clock, date, time, day, process, audio responsive, music player, interactive, visualizer, album cover, duration, web, animation, 4k, 21:9, progress, countdown, performance monitor, performance, task manager, weather",
